<title>USA: Darden restructuring to aid operations.</title>
<headline>Darden restructuring to aid operations.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Darden Restaurants Inc said Tuesday that it expects operating profits to benefit by $15 to $20 million annually from restructuring.</p>
<p>Darden reported a loss of $0.76 a share for the fourth quarter ended May 25, 1997, compared to a profit ot $0.22 a share the previous fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Fourth quarter 1997 results included a $230 million charge for restructuring and asset impairment. Excluding the charge, the company earned $0.19 a share in the quarter.</p>
